{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A protocol for model types that declare how to derive a global identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for Ensembles deduplication."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Syncable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : AnyObject","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/GettingStarted"]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Global identifiers let Ensembles recognize when objects created independently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on different devices represent the same logical entity, and merge them instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of duplicating."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are two ways to provide a global identifier:"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Simple: Single Property","level":3,"anchor":"Simple-Single-Property"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifierKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the name of a stored property:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Core Data","class Note: NSManagedObject, Syncable {","    static let globalIdentifierKey = \"uniqueID\"","    @NSManaged var uniqueID: String","}","","\/\/ SwiftData","@Model","class Tag: Syncable {","    static let globalIdentifierKey = \"name\"","    var name: String","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Advanced: Computed Identifier (Core Data)","level":3,"anchor":"Advanced-Computed-Identifier-Core-Data"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifier(from:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for compound or computed identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The parameter is typed as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":", so you get direct property access:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class Person: NSManagedObject, Syncable {","    @NSManaged var firstName: String","    @NSManaged var lastName: String","","    static func globalIdentifier(from person: Person) -> String {","        \"\\(person.firstName).\\(person.lastName)\"","    }","}"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifier(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" only works with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSManagedObject"},{"type":"text","text":" subclasses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Core Data). For SwiftData models, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifierKey"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A global identifier "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"must never change","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" once it has been assigned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to an object. Changing an identifier after sync has begun will cause Ensembles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to treat the object as a different entity, leading to duplicates or data loss."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use a value that is set once at creation time, such as a UUID string."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A UUID is usually the best choice for a global identifier. Use a fixed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meaningful value (like a name) only for singleton objects or reference data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like tags, where two devices might independently create the same logical object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When model types conform to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Syncable"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsembleContainer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftDataEnsembleContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" discover the identifiers automatically — no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegate or closure needed."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifierKey"],"title":"Type Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/Syncable\/globalIdentifier(from:)"],"title":"Type Methods"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Syncable","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:9Ensembles8SyncableP","title":"Syncable","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Syncable","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","symbolKind":"protocol","modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/syncable"]}],"references":{"doc://